                {"id": "a1pr19", "prompt": "\"Domani parto per Milano\" uses the present tense to express...", "options": ["a habit", "a near-future plan", "a general fact"], "answerIndex": 1, "explanation": "The present tense commonly covers planned near-future events in Italian."},
