                {"id": "a1pp14", "prompt": "\"Vengo da Napoli\" means...", "options": ["I'm going to Naples.", "I come from Naples.", "I live in Naples."], "answerIndex": 1, "explanation": "Da here expresses origin, \"from\"."},
